<title>FINLAND: Finnish PM Lipponen to visit European Commission May 5.</title>
<headline>Finnish PM Lipponen to visit European Commission May 5.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Prime Minister Paavo Lipponen will travel to Brussels to visit the European Commission on May 5, the government said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;He will meet Commission President Jacques Santer, Commissioner Yves-Thibault de Silguy and Commission Secretary General David Williamson,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Talks would be about the inter-governmental conference, European economic and monetary union, EU enlargement and the EU's northern dimension, it said.</p>
</text>
